{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43200","headline":"古兴二首 二 · 沈徽","name":"古兴二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长安富豪右，信是天下枢。\n戚里笙歌发，禁门冠盖趋。\n攀云无丑士，唾地尽成珠。\n日晏下双阙，烟花乱九衢。\n恩荣在片言，零落亦须臾。\n何意还自及，曲池今已芜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈徽","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43200.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43200","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}